## Reproduce

- Get **one command that fails reliably**: `{{reproduce_example}}` <!-- GEN: e.g. uv run pytest tests/unit/...::test_x -q -->
- Record it; it becomes the first evidence line and later the regression check.
- Cannot reproduce? Collect what you have (inputs, logs, revision, environment) and say so — do not change code blind.

## Read the real error

- The **whole** message and the **first** error, not the last one.
- The stack trace down to the first frame in this codebase.
- Logs: {{log_locations}} <!-- GEN: e.g. FastAPI console, worker log, browser console via the browser tool -->

## One failure at a time

Fix the first failure first; rerun; many later failures disappear with it.

